{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-037",
    "title": "最后一盏引路灯"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_231",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“我已经拒绝过一次。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟盟总坛的石门只撑了半刻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6694,
          "end": 6694
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光从门缝中渗入，先覆盖石阶，再爬上墙壁。墙上悬挂的旧盟约一张张鼓起，像纸下有手在推动。归墟盟主将黑色水池掀翻，池水化作一道墨墙，暂时挡住光潮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6696,
          "end": 6696
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总坛不能再留。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6698,
          "end": 6698
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是保存。”慧闻说，“是等待归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6722,
          "end": 6722
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向归墟盟主：“你早知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6724,
          "end": 6724
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道总坛下面有门，不知道门后是名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6726,
          "end": 6726
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "阶梯尽头是一片巨大的地下空洞。空洞中央悬着一座倒置的城，城墙向下，街道向上，所有屋舍都由灰白色石片拼成。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6728,
          "end": 6728
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是回川城？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6730,
          "end": 6730
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前的回川城。”慧闻答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6732,
          "end": 6732
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城门上方没有匾额，只有一道尚未闭合的裂缝。裂缝与天门天空中的裂缝完全相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6734,
          "end": 6734
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧灾不是从灵脉城开始。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6736,
          "end": 6736
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也不是从天门开始。”陆照临补充。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6738,
          "end": 6738
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主走到倒置城下，抬手触碰一块石片。石片立即显现出一段影像：三百年前，北境各州灵脉同时逆流，山川倒悬，凡人失去昨日，修士失去姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6740,
          "end": 6740
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "可它没有足够的力量。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6742,
          "end": 6742
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "于是它把一座城、一群人的记忆和三方经手人的真名填进裂口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6744,
          "end": 6744
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“失败了。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6746,
          "end": 6746
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么还能维持三百年？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6748,
          "end": 6748
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为失败的修补仍然比破裂好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6750,
          "end": 6750
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看着倒置城中数不清的灯：“所以那些人一直被困在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6752,
          "end": 6752
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们不是被困。”归墟盟主说，“他们是支撑世界的材料。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6754,
          "end": 6754
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前一步：“材料也有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6756,
          "end": 6756
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "倒置城内忽然响起钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6758,
          "end": 6758
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一座石楼从城墙上脱落，落入空洞底部。石楼碎裂后，露出里面密密麻麻的灯芯。每根灯芯上都刻着一个姓名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6760,
          "end": 6760
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看到一根灯芯上的字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6762,
          "end": 6762
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6764,
          "end": 6764
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他冲向倒置城门。城门却在他靠近前闭合，门缝中传来陆沉舟的声音：“这里不是我的家。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6766,
          "end": 6766
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你为什么不出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6768,
          "end": 6768
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人要留在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6770,
          "end": 6770
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6772,
          "end": 6772
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所有还没有被记住的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6774,
          "end": 6774
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临按住门面，金丹中的青色纹路立刻暴涨。门内灯芯同时点燃，倒置城的街道变成一片火海。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6776,
          "end": 6776
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬起无相镜：“别打开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6778,
          "end": 6778
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我能把他们带回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6780,
          "end": 6780
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只能把一部分带回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6782,
          "end": 6782
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一部分也好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6784,
          "end": 6784
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那剩下的呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6786,
          "end": 6786
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6788,
          "end": 6788
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到他身边，将铜环贴在城门上。铜环内侧浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6790,
          "end": 6790
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏经手人，第三次点灯未完成。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6792,
          "end": 6792
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我叔父来过这里。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6794,
          "end": 6794
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他没有离开。”叶观澜看着城内。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6796,
          "end": 6796
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我去找他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6798,
          "end": 6798
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会成为第四个经手人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6800,
          "end": 6800
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头：“如果没人接灯，灯会继续找别人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6802,
          "end": 6802
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主忽然取出一枚黑色令牌，令牌上刻着归墟盟主印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6804,
          "end": 6804
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我可以打开城门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6806,
          "end": 6806
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6808,
          "end": 6808
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让我成为新的门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6810,
          "end": 6810
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人同时看向他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6812,
          "end": 6812
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要替他们承担？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6814,
          "end": 6814
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我继承了改写权，也继承了改写的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6816,
          "end": 6816
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会失去什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6818,
          "end": 6818
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字、记忆和归墟盟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6820,
          "end": 6820
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜握紧刀：“不行。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6822,
          "end": 6822
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是盟主。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6824,
          "end": 6824
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可我是叶观澜。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6826,
          "end": 6826
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他抬刀劈向黑色令牌。令牌裂成两半，归墟盟主的脸色第一次变得难看。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6828,
          "end": 6828
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你拒绝继承？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6830,
          "end": 6830
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我拒绝替你决定谁该被牺牲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6832,
          "end": 6832
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "地下空洞开始震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6834,
          "end": 6834
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门的裂缝从倒置城上方延伸下来，贯穿地底与天空。裂缝尽头浮出一盏巨大的灯，灯火照亮整个空洞。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6836,
          "end": 6836
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见灯下站着陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6838,
          "end": 6838
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，父亲的脸清晰完整。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6840,
          "end": 6840
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6844,
          "end": 6844
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的声音很轻，像是早已在某份家族账本中见过这个名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6910,
          "end": 6910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向顾氏旧印：“那盏灯不是顾氏的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6912,
          "end": 6912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“但顾氏有点亮它的方法。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6914,
          "end": 6914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6916,
          "end": 6916
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有回答。她从袖中取出三枚铜针，分别刺入自己的指尖、腕骨和心口。血沿针身流下，在地面画出一条完整的顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6918,
          "end": 6918
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抓住她的手：“你要做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6920,
          "end": 6920
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把债还到我这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6922,
          "end": 6922
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不是你的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6924,
          "end": 6924
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏把灯交给了我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6926,
          "end": 6926
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你可以拒绝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6928,
          "end": 6928
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经拒绝过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6930,
          "end": 6930
        }
      }
    ],
